## The Landing

::bg{location="skerry_landing" time="day"}
@narrator{code="0010"}: The iron steps go down into green water. Weed hangs from the chain like wet hair.
@narrator{code="0020"}: Something dark is jammed in the chain above the tide line. A coat.
@narrator{code="0030"}: On the lowest step, fresh scrapes in the weed: a small boat tied up here, and not long ago.
@inspector{code="0010" mono}: The Guillemot came ashore on the north side, in pieces. Whoever tied up here came in something that still floats.
